{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Tested Abraham.</b> So that he would be a lover and one who fears in actuality, just as he was in potentiality — and in this he would more closely resemble his Creator, who is good to the world in actuality. For indeed the intent in the existence of man was that he resemble his Creator as far as possible, as He testified in saying: נַעֲשֶׂה אָדָם בְּצַלְמֵנוּ כִּדְמוּתֵנוּ (Genesis 1:26)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:06.944349753Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}